      "uid": "zhcn:ae0514526768b43af8f92df5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那晚，我思索着自己还能为\n对“月桂杯”提起干劲的她，\n做些什么事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "224f7dc7146f9515b7be4c3a3a668e6a55b58d2c98c0aa5bd642b9f0b7533dca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
