      "uid": "zhcn:8763b5fc6f8c90e895228a3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定有什么事是只有训练员\n才能做到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c7234a16c2431b062c61851eb9a5884ee22010fd05319a02c0a28790584efe6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
