      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我将“月桂杯”的参赛者名单，\n还有过去的资料依序研究一遍──\n等我回过神时已经天亮了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccbf6e0bfe333597281f8ce059d48cdc760ea5010e89ce43ef55c65421fd4415",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
